    <string name="about_guide_buttons_title">🔘 BUTTONS &amp; FEATURES GUIDE / BUTON VE ÖZELLİK REHBERİ</string>
    <string name="about_guide_buttons_content">• 🚨 DISASTER MODE (Afet Kipi): Transmits emergency signals (blood group, medical notes, rubble info) via UDP Multicast and Bluetooth Mesh without cellular network or internet.\n• 🎙️ RUBBLE AUDIO LISTENER &amp; AMPLIFIER (Enkaz Dinleme): Real-time microphone audio filtering, frequency isolation, 3x/5x/10x gain boost, and peak noise/tapping detection for rubble rescue operations.\n• 🔄 MULTI-HOP MESH RELAY: Automatically relays emergency signals across nearby devices to extend coverage area with loop prevention.\n• 🔴 BROADCAST SWITCH (Yayın Butonu): Activates Disaster Mode. Panic buttons are locked while broadcast is OFF to prevent accidental sends.\n• 🆘 EMERGENCY ACTION BUTTONS: One-touch buttons (SOS, I Am Safe, Need Help) to report immediate status.\n• 📞 VOICE &amp; VIDEO CALLS: Direct peer-to-peer serverless communication over local Wi-Fi/mesh networks.</string>
    <string name="about_guide_settings_title">⚙️ SETTINGS MENU GUIDE / AYARLAR MENÜSÜ REHBERİ</string>
    <string name="about_guide_settings_content">• 🌐 Address Management (Adres Yönetimi): Select local IP addresses included in your QR code so contacts can reach you.\n• 🔄 Automatic Contact Updates (Otomatik Durum Güncellemeleri): Periodically pings saved contacts to update ONLINE/OFFLINE status badges.\n• 📞 Auto Accept Calls (Aramaları Otomatik Kabul): Automatically answers incoming voice/video calls.\n• 🎙️ Push to Talk (Bas-Konuş): Enables walkie-talkie mode (press and hold to send audio).\n• 🌙 Night Mode &amp; Themes (Gece Kipi ve Temalar): Switch between Light, Dark, or System theme and select safety colors.\n• 🔒 Startup Password (Başlangıç Parolası): Encrypts app database and restricts unauthorized access.</string>
    <string name="about_app_update_title">🚀 CHECK FOR UPDATES / UYGULAMAYI GÜNCELLE</string>
    <string name="about_app_update_description">Click to download the latest release APK directly from GitHub:</string>
    <string name="about_app_update_link" translatable="false">https://github.com/mserman90/meshenger-android/releases</string>
    <string name="about_thanks_title">❤️ REFERENCES &amp; SPECIAL THANKS / YARARLANILAN PROJELER</string>
    <string name="about_thanks_content">• Enkaz Dinleme Uygulaması (Rubble Audio listening, noise filtering &amp; gain amplification algorithms):\n  https://github.com/ozansarier/enkazdinlemeuygulamasi\n\n• Original Meshenger Android Project (P2P WebRTC communication engine):\n  https://github.com/meshenger-app/meshenger-android\n\n• qaul.net (Off-grid wireless mesh communication concept):\n  https://github.com/qaul/qaul.net\n\n• WebRTC Project (Real-time P2P streaming engine):\n  https://webrtc.org\n\n• Libsodium / LazySodium (Cryptographic security &amp; E2E key library):\n  https://libsodium.org\n\n• ISO 22324 International Standard (Emergency management color-coded alert guidelines):\n  https://www.iso.org/standard/50060.html\n\n🙏 SPECIAL THANKS: To search and rescue teams, open-source contributors, and everyone working to save lives.</string>
    <string name="address_management">Address Management</string>
    <string name="address_management_help_text">Select one or more IP addresses that will be included in the QR code you can will share. These addresses will be used by others to reach you. Be aware that the IP address change depending on the network. Enable your WLAN if no IP address is visible.</string>
    <string name="app_description">MeshengerTR is an open-source, serverless off-grid peer-to-peer communication &amp; emergency disaster beaconing app. It enables encrypted voice/video calls over local networks without internet or central servers, and includes Disaster Mode (UDP Multicast + BLE Mesh), Rubble Audio Listener with 3x/5x/10x amplification &amp; noise filter, Multi-hop Mesh Relay, and ISO 22324 safety color standards.</string>
